{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">كُتيِّب الشرح</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">بتاع</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">لوحات دِلماس المساعِدة</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">السلسلة الأولى</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">اللوحة نمرة ١</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">المدرسة. — الثانوية. — الفصل.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">وصف عام.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — اللوحة دي بتوَرِّي <b>فصل</b> في <b>ثانوية</b>. في الفصل ده تمن <b>ترابيزات</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> وتمن <b>بنوك</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. على كل بنك قاعدين تلات تلامذة. و<b>المدرِّس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> قاعد على <b>كرسي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> قدام <b>دِكّته</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — على شمال الدكة في <b>دولاب</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> <b>قزاز</b>. وعلى اليمين <b>السبورة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> ومعاها <b>الطلّاسة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> و<b>الطباشير</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"وفوق الدكة متعلَّقة <b>لوحات حيطة</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> و<b>خريطة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — مش كل التلامذة قاعدين في <b>أماكنهم</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. يوحنا <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> واقف عند السبورة؛ ماسك الطلّاسة وبيمسح <b>الأشكال الهندسية</b>.","t01-03-2":"وبطرس جنب الدكة؛ بيلمّ <b>الواجبات المكتوبة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> وبيوَدِّيها للمدرِّس.","t01-04-1":"4. — المدرِّس <b>ده</b> هو مدرِّس <b>اللغات الحيَّة</b>. بيعلّم التلامذة يتكلّموا اللغات الأجنبية ويقروها ويكتبوها <b>(ألماني وإنجليزي وإسباني وإيطالي وروسي</b> أو <b>فرنساوي)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — الفصل واسع أوي ومنوَّر أوي. في آخره <b>شباك</b> عريض ليه <b>شبّاكين تهوية</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> و<b>باب قزاز</b>، علشان يهوّوه وينوّروه.","t01-05-2":"والفصل ده مش بارد. في نُصّه، علشان يدفّيه، في <b>صوبة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> كويسة أوي مع <b>ماسورتها</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"وفي الحاجز <b>شمّاعات</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> متثبّتة؛ التلامذة بيعلّقوا فيها طواقيهم وبلاطيهم.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">حوش اللعب.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>الساعة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> بتوَرِّي تسعة وخمس دقايق.","t01-06-2":"<b>الفسحة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> لسه خالصة والدرس بيبتدي تاني. اللعب بيبقى في <b>الحوش</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. إحنا شايفين كام تلميذ بيلعبوا. و<b>مساعد المدرِّس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> بيراقبهم.","t01-07-1":"7. — في الحوش كمان شايفين ناس تانيين، يعني <b>المفتِّش</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>، و<b>ناظر المدرسة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button>، و<b>الوكيل</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"المفتِّش بيفتِّش على المدارس، والناظر بيدير المدرسة، والوكيل بيراقب المذاكرة.","t01-07-3":"والشخص الرابع هو <b>الفرّاش</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. ماسك تحت باطه دفتر علشان يكتب فيه الغايبين.","t01-08-1":"8. — في آخر الحوش في <b>أجهزة الجمباز</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> و<b>الورشة</b> بتاعة <b>الشغل اليدوي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"وعلى يمين اللوحة بنشوف <b>فصول</b> <b>الموسيقى</b> و<b>الرسم</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">وصف بالتفصيل.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">التلامذة الشاطرين.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — تلامذة البنك الأول على يمين الدكة هم <b>هنريكوس</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"arz-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>، و<b>ستيفانوس</b>، و<b>كارولوس</b>.","t01-09-2":"هنريكوس واخد باله أوي وبيحب الشغل، وبيسمع كلام المدرِّس. على ترابيزته عنده <b>كراسة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>، و<b>كتاب</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>، و<b>قاموس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button>، و<b>مقلمة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. كتابه فيه <b>صفحات</b> كتير، وكل فصل فيه كذا <b>فقرة</b>، وكل <b>سطر</b> فيه <b>كلمات</b> كتير.","t01-09-4":"جاره ستيفانوس <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> مجتهد. بيكتب في كراسته درس المرة الجاية. <b>خطّه</b> حلو. كتابه مقفول. إحنا شايفين <b>الغلاف</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button> بس. وجنبه <b>الفرجار</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"كارولوس <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> ماسك كتابه بإيده، وبيفتحه علشان يراجع درسه. عنده، زي كل تلميذ، <b>دواية</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> قدامه. وده ولد سامع الكلام.","t01-10-1":"10. — على الترابيزة اللي جنبها <b>لودوفيكوس</b>، و<b>أنطونيوس</b>، و<b>باولوس</b>. لودوفيكوس بيسمّع <b>درسه</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> وبيرد على <b>أسئلة</b> المدرِّس. أنطونيوس <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> مش واخد باله خالص، وساعات المدرِّس بيعاقبه. باولوس <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> زميل كويس، لطيف وبيحب يساعد. وهو واخد باله أوي.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">التلامذة الوحشين.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — ورا هنريكوس قاعد <b>جورجيوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. مش ولد وحش، بس <b>بيرغي</b> كتير، ومش واخد باله، وشقي. <b>استخفافه</b> و<b>عناده</b> بيعملوا <b>لخبطة</b> في الدرس، وكتير بيستاهل <b>إنذار</b> شديد. <b>كراسة المسوّدة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> بتاعته وسخة، بيلطّخها بالحبر بـ<b>القلم</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> بتاعه، وعلشان كده دايمًا بيستعمل <b>الأستيكة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> بتاعته؛ و<b>شنطة الكراريس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> بتاعته مقطّعة، علشان هو مهمل أوي. هو جايب <b>علبة الأقلام</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> بتاعته ليه في فصل <b>اللغات الحيَّة</b>؟","t01-11-2":"جاره إدموندوس <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> مش بيحبه. هو الحقيقة كسلان شوية، بس ساكت وهادي. مش بيرغي؛ إنما بدل ما يسمع، بيفضّل يقرا <b>الحواديت</b> اللي في <b>كتاب القراءة</b> بتاعه.","t01-11-3":"تالت تلميذ في البنك ده هو <b>لودوفيكوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. ده مجتهد. بيكتب على <b>ورقة</b> بيضا. وقدامه حطّ <b>ورقة النشّاف</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — تلامذة البنك التاني، على شمال المدرِّس، صغيّرين أوي. الأول، <b>إميليوس</b> الصغير، لسه مش عارف يكتب كويس، جايب <b>اللوح</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button> بتاعه، و<b>قلم الحجر</b> بتاعه، و<b>السفنجة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> بتاعته.","t01-12-2":"وجنبه <b>أوغوستوس</b> و<b>برناردوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. ده بيشتغل كويس، بس <b>هدومه</b> مهملة أوي.","t01-13-1":"13. — وراهم في تلات <b>كسالى. ألبرتوس</b> مش بيذاكر دروسه. و<b>ياكوبوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> بينام بدل ما يسمع. <b>كسله</b> بيجيب له <b>عتاب</b> وكمان <b>عقاب</b>. وأخيرًا <b>كريستيانوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> مش جدع خالص. <b>بيتصرّف</b> وحش ومش بيحاول يصلّح نفسه.","t01-14-1":"14. — جيرانه بالعكس <b>مؤدَّبين</b>. <b>إرنستوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> بيحب النظام والترتيب، دايمًا بيستعمل <b>المسطرة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> بتاعته و<b>القلم الرصاص</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button> بتاعه. وده <b>تلميذ خارجي</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>فرانسيسكوس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>تلميذ داخلي</b>، لابس بدلة موحّدة، وبياكل وبينام في المدرسة. وده <b>زميل</b> كويس.","t01-14-3":"موريسيوس بيبري <b>قلمه</b> بـ<b>مطواته</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>، وده بيهتم أوي.","t01-14-4":"جايب كل كتبه، و<b>النحو</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button> بتاعه، و<b>النوتة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> بتاعته، وكمان <b>مخدّة الكتابة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. و<b>شنطة المدرسة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> بتاعته على الأرض وراه.","t01-14-5":"والترابيزتين اللي في آخر الفصل قاعد عليهم <b>التلامذة الشاطرين</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">رسم وموسيقى.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — في <b>فصل الرسم</b> في <b>موديلات</b> حلوة متعلّقة على الحيطة، و<b>لمبة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> ليها <b>أباجورة</b>، متعلّقة في السقف. و<b>المدرِّس</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> صبور أوي، بيصلّح <b>رسومات</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> التلامذة وبيعلّمهم يرسموا <b>تمثال نصفي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> من الطبيعة.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>فصل الموسيقى</b> شكله مشوّق أوي. فيه بيتعلّموا يقروا <b>الموسيقى</b>، ويسولفجوا <b>النوتات</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> المكتوبة على <b>المدرّج</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.)، ويعرفوا <b>المفاتيح</b>، ويغنّوا <b>ألحان</b> حلوة. والنوتة بتتحطّ على <b>الحامل</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. وواحد من التلامذة <b>بيلعب على البيانو</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> و<b>مدرِّس الموسيقى</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>بيضبط الوزن</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — بنشوف ركن من <b>الورشة</b> بتاعة <b>الشغل اليدوي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>، اللي فيها الولاد يقدروا يتعلّموا يشتغلوا الخشب بالفارة ويبردوا الحديد. ده مش موجود في كل الثانويات.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">فصل العلوم.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — مدرِّس الرياضة بيعلّم التلامذة <b>الهندسة والحساب والعمليات</b> و<b>النظام المتري</b>. وعلى اللوحة إحنا شايفين الأشكال الهندسية الأساسية: <b>دايرة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>، و<b>مربّع</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>، و<b>مثلث</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>، و<b>خط</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"وشايفين كمان <b>عملية</b>، دي مش <b>جمع</b>، ولا <b>طرح</b>، ولا <b>ضرب</b>، دي <b>قسمة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — وعلى لوحة النظام المتري إحنا شايفين: <b>متر</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>، و<b>ميزان</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> و<b>صنجه</b>، و<b>لتر</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>، و<b>ديكالتر</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>، و<b>ديسيلتر</b>، و<b>متر مكعّب</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"والتلامذة بيدرسوا كمان <b>علوم الطبيعة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>، وعلم الحيوان <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>، وعلم النبات <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>، وعلم طبقات الأرض <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>، و<b>التاريخ</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"وفي الدولاب أجهزة <b>الطبيعة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> و<b>الكيميا</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"وفوق الدولاب: <b>كرة</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>، و<b>مخروط</b>، و<b>كرة أرضية</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"وفوق اللوحات متعلّقة <b>خريطة</b> بتوَرِّي أجزاء الدنيا الخمسة: <b>أوروبا</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>، و<b>آسيا</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>، و<b>أفريقيا</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>، و<b>أمريكا</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>، و<b>أوقيانوسيا</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>، والمحيطين الكبار، <b>الباسيفيكي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> و<b>الأطلنطي</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) بالنسبة <i>لأسامي المعمودية</i> كمان الأحسن إنك تكتبها على الصورة اللاتينية. دي الطريقة الوحيدة اللي تخلّصك من اختلافات ما لهاش آخر. وبعدين تختار إزاي بين <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> وهكذا؟ هنعمل قاموس مخصوص لأسامي المعمودية؟ خلّينا ناخد من اللاتيني حالة الرفع بتاعتها ونقول: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus;</b> <b>Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)."}}
